- Updated ADR-0038 and the Phase 6 API, requirement, Java compatibility, and runtime inventory records. Additional Fastjson grammar forms, source/input reconciliation, non-macOS interface enumeration and a real IPv6-only host remain open. Phase 6 remains PARTIAL; P6-V04 stays `PENDING_PHASE_19`.

