## Fastjson SOCKS special references — 2026-10-09T19:06:01Z

- Added actual pinned Java constructor and private `getProxy` cases for `$ref` `#-1` and root `$`. Java accepts `#-1` as a null/no-address route and selects no proxy; root `$` fails construction with `ClassCastException`. The native constructor differential failed first on both outcomes: it rejected `#-1` and accepted `$`.
